  (config#verbose || config#show_errors) guard silently dropped boxes 2-N
  when multiple tests fail in the same suite.
- Add INCOMPLETE.md: documents the patch conventions, files touched, and
  the e2e regression test for the [INCOMPLETE] verdict.
- .gitignore: ignore .DS_Store.

